 ('补充Fig.6/7：Input Masking对比原尺度/裁剪缩放inpainting','Supplement Figs.6/7: Input Masking versus original-scale/cropped-resized inpainting','两个替代条件及完整双向消融未运行；形态学掩码扰动不是替代','Two alternative conditions and full bidirectional ablation not run; morphological perturbation is not a substitute','paper-comparison.html'),
 ('我们新增：分割扰动/固定概念分配稳定性','Our extension: segmentation perturbation / fixed-basis assignment stability','r1十类完整；其余条件仅六类完整，四类失败保留','r1 complete for ten classes; remaining conditions complete for six, with four failures retained','robustness.html'),
