 body=p('不是所有原文验证都已完成。十类发现与四方法faithfulness已齐，最主要的科研缺口是正式人类实验和Input Masking消融。补充的分割扰动与医学迁移回答不同的问题。','Not all paper validation is complete. Ten-class discovery and four-method faithfulness are available; the main scientific gaps are the formal human study and Input Masking ablation. Additional segmentation and medical experiments answer different questions.','lead')
