 body+=h('人类实验不是现有自动验收的别名','The human study is not another name for automated acceptance')+p('论文41名参与者完成任务预测并描述候选概念，报告四项指标、ANOVA及两两t检验；另分析唯一描述。我们没有这些参与者数据。原文人类实验的MCD至少五概念配置与当前faithfulness搜索不同：Hummingbird、Siamese Cat、Police Van、Beach Wagon、Zebra、Ox均少于五概念；ACE Golden仅三概念，也不足以直接构造五候选题目。','The paper’s41 participants performed task prediction and described candidates, yielding four metrics, ANOVA, pairwise t-tests and an additional unique-description analysis. We have no equivalent participant data. Its human-study MCD minimum-five configuration differs from our faithfulness search: Hummingbird, Siamese Cat, Police Van, Beach Wagon, Zebra and Ox have fewer than five concepts. ACE Golden has only three, also insufficient for direct five-candidate questions.')
