   parts=[(f"MCD原非离群聚类成员中，{r['same_named_retained_concept_members']}/{r['nonoutlier_initial_members']}（{pct(r['fraction'])}）最终仍归入同索引保留概念。它反映从聚类规则到子空间分配规则后的成员变化，不是语义正确率。",f"Of MCD's original non-outlier cluster members, {r['same_named_retained_concept_members']}/{r['nonoutlier_initial_members']} ({pct(r['fraction'])}) end in the corresponding retained concept. This measures membership change from clustering to subspace assignment, not semantic correctness."),('ACE图含后来未保留的候选，MCD包含最初离群行；二者分母与过滤不同，不应比较对角线比例作为方法质量。只有对照同一个片段ID才能定位转移，随机示例组本身不构成前后配对。','ACE includes later-filtered candidates and MCD includes initial outliers. Different denominators/filtering prevent comparing diagonal fractions as quality. A transition requires matching the same segment ID; random example sets are not paired before/after data.')]
