 path=S/'robustness.html';text=path.read_text();text=add_after_chart(text,'hub/figures/robustness.png','robustness-discussion',[('观察：r1侵蚀在十类完成，类内图片均值再十类等权为78.25%；更强侵蚀及膨胀只有六类完整，四类缺失由缩批一致性失败导致，未当作0。','Observation: radius1 erosion completes ten classes, yielding78.25% after image-then-equal-class averaging. Stronger erosion/dilation complete only six classes; four missing classes failed reduced-batch consistency and are not zero-valued.'),(f"同六类对照：r1为{pct(paired['erosion1'])}，r2为{pct(paired['erosion2'])}，r1/r2膨胀为{pct(paired['dilation1'])}/{pct(paired['dilation2'])}。更强侵蚀下分配保持下降，但只适用于这六类。",f"Matched six-class comparison: erosion1={pct(paired['erosion1'])}, erosion2={pct(paired['erosion2'])}; dilation1/2={pct(paired['dilation1'])}/{pct(paired['dilation2'])}. Stronger erosion reduces retention in these six classes only."),('解释：这是固定概念基对几何掩码扰动的分配稳定性，不是分割准确率，也不是论文Fig.7的inpainting消融。缺失不是随机可忽略，不能用六类结果冒充十类总体。','Interpretation: this measures fixed-basis assignment stability under geometric perturbation, not segmentation accuracy or Fig.7 inpainting ablation. Missing classes cannot be assumed ignorable; six-class results are not ten-class estimates.')]);path.write_text(text)
